		<!-- 冻土地带-野性苔原 -->
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_WILD_TUNDRA_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>野性苔原</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_WILD_TUNDRA_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>该城市可在平坦的冻土上建造营地改良设施，且建造在该 [ICON_SUK_REGION] 地带上的营地+2 [ICON_Food] 食物+2 [ICON_Gold] 金币，该城市训练的侦察单位+2 [ICON_Movement] 移动力。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_WILD_TUNDRA_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>苔原辽阔，风霜凛冽。这里的每一寸土地，都刻着顽强与自由的印记。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ABILITY_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_WILD_TUNDRA_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>{LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_WILD_TUNDRA_NAME}</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ABILITY_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_WILD_TUNDRA_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>+2 [ICON_Movement] 移动力（{LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_WILD_TUNDRA_NAME}）</Text>
		</Replace>

		<!-- 冻土地带-可可西里 -->
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_HOH_XIL_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>可可西里</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_HOH_XIL_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>该 [ICON_SUK_REGION] 地带上的单位-1 [ICON_Movement] 移动力，该城市的单元格+1魅力，该城市建造保护区和其中的建筑时+30% [ICON_Production] 生产力。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_HOH_XIL_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>荒原无际，藏羚羊踏雪而行。这片“美丽的少女”，以极寒守护着生命的尊严与野性的自由。</Text>
		</Replace>

		<!-- 雪地地带-科考前沿 -->
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_SCIENTIFIC_FRONTIER_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>科考前沿</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_SCIENTIFIC_FRONTIER_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>该城市建造学院时+30% [ICON_Production] 生产力，且学院从雪地获得+1 [ICON_Science] 科技值相邻加成。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_SCIENTIFIC_FRONTIER_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>白雪皑皑，静默无声。然而在这片极寒之地，智慧的火花却从未熄灭。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ID_SUK_ML_SCIENTIFIC_FRONTIER_CAMPUS_SCIENCE" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>从相邻的雪地单元格获得+{1_num} [ICON_Science] 科技值。</Text>
		</Replace>

		<!-- 海滨地带-洋流交汇 -->
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_CONFLUENCE_OF_CURRENTS_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>洋流交汇</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_CONFLUENCE_OF_CURRENTS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>该 [ICON_SUK_REGION] 地带的单元格提供+1 [ICON_Food] 食物，已改良的水域单元格+2 [ICON_Gold] 金币。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_CONFLUENCE_OF_CURRENTS_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>海水在此相拥，鱼群在此繁衍。潮起潮落间，是大海最慷慨的赠礼。</Text>
		</Replace>

		<!-- 海滨地带-多变海域 -->
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_CAPRICIOUS_SEAS_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>多变海域</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_CAPRICIOUS_SEAS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
