		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_CAPRICIOUS_SEAS_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>海面瞬息万变，风浪无常。唯有虔诚者，方能从波涛中窥见神明的低语。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ID_SUK_ML_CAPRICIOUS_SEAS_HOLY_SITE_FAITH" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>从相邻的海岸和湖泊单元格获得+{1_num} [ICON_Faith] 信仰值。</Text>
		</Replace>


		<!-- 半沙地带-河西走廊 -->
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_HEXI_CORRIDOR_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>河西走廊</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_HEXI_CORRIDOR_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>该城市的军营从沙漠获得+1 [ICON_Production] 生产力相邻加成，建造在该 [ICON_SUK_REGION] 地带上的农场+2 [ICON_Food] 食物。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_HEXI_CORRIDOR_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>长风万里，古道西行。这片平原，见证了无数驼铃与征尘。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ID_SUK_ML_HEXI_CORRIDOR_ENCAMPMENT_PRODUCTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>从相邻的沙漠单元格获得+{1_num} [ICON_Production] 生产力。</Text>
		</Replace>


		<!-- 山脉地带-垂直气候 -->
