		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_YEW_GROVE_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>紫杉挺拔，箭矢如风。这里的树木，曾经造就了无数神弓劲弩。</Text>
		</Replace>

