		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ID_SUK_ML_OASIS_TRADING_POST_COMMERCIAL_HUB_GOLD" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>从相邻的绿洲单元格获得+{1_num} [ICON_Gold] 金币。</Text>
		</Replace>

