		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_IDENTITY_SUK_ML_VOLCANIC_SANCTUM_FLAVOR" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>地火涌动，神灵低语。火山脚下，信仰与毁灭共存。</Text>
		</Replace>
